wf-crew-setup-task-help-hold = Stop and hold position. Use 0 seconds to hold until you skip this task.
wf-crew-setup-task-help-goto = Travel to map coordinates, then continue to the next task. Distance sets the arrival tolerance.
wf-crew-setup-task-help-dock = Approach a compatible port and physically dock. Continues when connected; requires a pilot and a usable docking port.
wf-crew-setup-task-help-undock = Release the ship's docks and back clear, then continue to the next task.
wf-crew-setup-task-help-loiter = Circle the selected grid at the chosen distance. Use 0 seconds to loiter until skipped.
wf-crew-setup-task-help-follow = Stay near the selected grid at the chosen distance. Use 0 seconds to follow until skipped.
wf-crew-setup-task-help-escort = Stay in formation beside and behind the target. Distance sets minimum spacing. Use 0 seconds to escort until skipped.
wf-crew-setup-task-help-attack = Circle and engage using the crew's flight tuning: defaults are 6 m/s and a minimum radius of 350 metres, plus hull clearance. Requires a gunner, powered ship guns and ammunition. Use 0 seconds to attack until skipped.
wf-crew-setup-task-help-retreat = Travel toward the selected grid, then continue on arrival. Distance sets the arrival tolerance.
wf-crew-setup-task-help-repair = Hold while deckhands repair equipment and restore the ship's saved layout with their built-in SRD. Continues when work is complete.
wf-crew-setup-task-help-resupply = Dock and bring reachable loose ammunition and filled oxygen tanks aboard. Requires a pilot, deckhand and suitable EVA equipment.
wf-crew-setup-task-help-salvage = Dock and collect reachable loose material stacks. Requires a pilot, deckhand and suitable EVA equipment. Does not dismantle structures or mine rock.
wf-crew-setup-task-help-loot = Dock and carry a few loose items back from the target. Requires a pilot and a deckhand; the crew fight anyone hostile they see aboard.
wf-crew-setup-task-help-circle = Circle the selected grid using the crew's Circle speed, 4 m/s by default. Distance is measured from its center and increases when needed to clear both hulls. Use 0 seconds to circle until skipped.
wf-crew-objective-circle = Circle grid (slow)
